# CupidMQ — code-derived map

**Tagline:** The brokerless P2P message queue where the master only plays matchmaker.

**Status:** experimental. **Pull matchmaker** + **P2P data plane** (TCP BATC). Model: **1 control channel** (master) + **direct producer→consumer delivery** with ACK.

**Repo:** standalone `cupidmq/` · branch **`main`** · `https://github.com/WilianZilv/cupidmq`

**External consumption** (no clone): [README#use-in-your-project](README.md#use-in-your-project) · [RELEASING.md](RELEASING.md)

