## Wire protocol (`src/protocol.rs`)

| Magic | Direction | Use |
|-------|-----------|-----|
| **`PRDY`** | Producer → master | Producer ready — local ring has items, requests match |
| **`HBRP`** | Producer → master | Heartbeat backlog (pending + ring + drops) |
| **`ASGN`** | Master → producer | Data dest `host:port`, max_items, tag |
| **`DELV`** | Producer → master | BATC delivered (msg_count, batch_bytes) |
| **`FAIL`** | Producer → master | Delivery failed; items requeued on producer |
| **`REG!`** | Consumer → master | Register data TCP endpoint `host:port` |
| **`CRDY`** | Consumer → master | Consumer ready — pull batch (max_items + consumer_tag) |
| **`BATC`** | Producer → consumer | Batch wire frame |
| **`ERR!`** | Master → client (control) | Protocol error on `:9750` channel |

Limits: item ≤ **32 MiB**; batch frame ≤ **64 MiB**. BATC uses `write_vectored`; extra flush if &lt; **64 KiB** (`FLUSH_BELOW_BYTES`).

